                        "review": "This is a very different game than Lux Delux.\n\nOn balance I prefer this approach where you all plan your actions then execute at same time\n\nIt's a risk type \"light\" wargame with some great maps.\n\nThere are a lot of extra maps to download and as the community votes on them you can get a reasonable idea of which ones players think are worth downloading and playing.\n\nReally pleased with this purchase.",
